# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo regardless of a contributor's
# local git config -- without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true,
# a common Git for Windows default) convert tracked text files to CRLF on
# checkout, so any script that rewrites one with plain LF (e.g. the
# marketing agents' JSON writes) shows up as a spurious full-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
